  "item_short_desc": "<p>Dominate the sun and great outdoors with our Adjustable Boonie Hat. With a wide, structured brim, these military boonie hats provide 360-degree defense from the sun while shading your neck and face, keeping you cool when out in the field. These boonie bucket hats are great for fishing, hunting, camping, hiking, and other outdoor activities.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "4061",
  "description": "<p>Dominate the sun and great outdoors with our Adjustable Boonie Hat. With a wide, structured brim, these military boonie hats provide 360-degree defense from the sun while shading your neck and face, keeping you cool when out in the field. These boonie bucket hats are great for fishing, hunting, camping, hiking, and other outdoor activities.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Rugged &amp; Long-Lasting:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These adjustable bucket hats are built with a breathable 55% cotton / 45% polyester blend (MultiCam = 65% polyester / 35% cotton rip-stop) for unmatched resiliency and easy-to-care for maintenance. These boonie hats easily withstand rigorous outdoor use and sun exposure while providing a comfortable fit and feel.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Utility at the Forefront:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>This fishing hat features 4 screen side vents that keep you cool by circulating hot or humid air away from your head, allowing you to focus on the task at hand. The internal map pocket provides a place to store maps, paperwork, and extra money.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>One Size Fits Most:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Our outdoor bucket hats use an adjustable elastic cord with a cord lock that cinches at the crown for a perfect fit that accommodates most hat sizes (6 3/4 &ndash; 7 3/4). In addition, the adjustable chin strap ensures the boonie stays in place during a windy day or when you&rsquo;re on-the-go.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Got You Covered:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Keep your head in the game with Rothco&rsquo;s collection of headwear and accessories. Designed with precision and purpose, our headgear is built to withstand the harshest conditions. Whether you&rsquo;re tackling the cold in one of our Watch Caps or Balaclavas, or out on a mission in a Boonie Hat or Fatigue Cap, our diverse range of headwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts.</li>\n</ul>",
